    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνστάζω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ξω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drop in</i> or <i>into,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					702
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.63
			</span></i> (tm.); [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριν] φρασίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					12.229
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπαλὰς τροφάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.470
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ δή τοι σοῦ πατρὸς
				ἐνέστακται μένος ἠΰ</span>
			<i>is instilled into</i> thee, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.271
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλά οἱ δεινός τις ἐνέστακτο ἵμερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				4.32.4
			</span></i>.</div>
